  _glyph: "\U0001F33C\uFE0F"
  _subtitle: Sleep forever
  _description: Scarlet poppies whose scent puts anyone who breathes it to sleep.
    The [[ee41e80d-2956-479b-b6eb-dc5abc1ac98a|Scarecrow]] and the [[2068ec5f-e108-487b-a58a-19fa835fb595|Tin
    Woodman]] do not breathe, so they carry [[fcbf3650-903d-4ed3-a6f8-79e222116920|Dorothy
    Gale]] out.
